    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/cf94ec910fe06cf064fa9bafdc821401.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a thrilling adventure in Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfde\ufe0fExplore a stunning world inspired by the beauty of the Amazon rainforest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0fFight against creatures and entities inspired by the rich and vibrant myths and legends of Brazilian Folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca3Discover new places by mastering new abilities such as swimming, exploding bombs, and Metroidvania-like gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9Wield a variety of unique weapons including bows, magical bombs, spears, zarabatanas, and crafted shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9Solve challenging puzzles in mysterious dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcdMeet and interact with a cast of unforgettable original characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdcExperience an epic story that will keep you engaged and enthralled from beginning to end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Immerse yourself in the game's original soundtrack that captures the spirit of the game's world and its characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its unique cartoon 3D visuals, exciting gameplay, and epic storytelling, Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge will take you on an unforgettable journey through the Zaltana continent. Solve puzzles, uncover ancient treasures, and learn to wield native weapons as you explore a world filled with danger and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you up to the challenge of defeating Ojibe and restoring the balance of the world? Put your wits and skills to the test in Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist it now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat Epic Bosses inspired by Brazilian Folklore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/2f652ab5622ed6fb9ad27e7fdea8a0e7.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve many puzzles in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/21b11d4401f4262cadc88fa6ec7515d3.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and discover hidden places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/645a897772d75f5dcdcfb5fc8918cbc2.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft New Items to Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/fbf88d1132eed829857fd14ea58efa32.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Unique Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/80620e3da0adc1c79446f1437158b630.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">To request features, enhancements or comunicate issues join us on our discord channel</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/cf94ec910fe06cf064fa9bafdc821401.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embark on a thrilling adventure in Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfde\ufe0fExplore a stunning world inspired by the beauty of the Amazon rainforest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0fFight against creatures and entities inspired by the rich and vibrant myths and legends of Brazilian Folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca3Discover new places by mastering new abilities such as swimming, exploding bombs, and Metroidvania-like gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9Wield a variety of unique weapons including bows, magical bombs, spears, zarabatanas, and crafted shields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9Solve challenging puzzles in mysterious dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcdMeet and interact with a cast of unforgettable original characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdcExperience an epic story that will keep you engaged and enthralled from beginning to end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Immerse yourself in the game's original soundtrack that captures the spirit of the game's world and its characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its unique cartoon 3D visuals, exciting gameplay, and epic storytelling, Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge will take you on an unforgettable journey through the Zaltana continent. Solve puzzles, uncover ancient treasures, and learn to wield native weapons as you explore a world filled with danger and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you up to the challenge of defeating Ojibe and restoring the balance of the world? Put your wits and skills to the test in Caapora Adventure: Ojibe's Revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist it now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OVERVIEW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat Epic Bosses inspired by Brazilian Folklore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/2f652ab5622ed6fb9ad27e7fdea8a0e7.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve many puzzles in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/21b11d4401f4262cadc88fa6ec7515d3.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and discover hidden places</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/645a897772d75f5dcdcfb5fc8918cbc2.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft New Items to Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/fbf88d1132eed829857fd14ea58efa32.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Unique Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427620/extras/80620e3da0adc1c79446f1437158b630.avif?t=1739655449\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">To request features, enhancements or comunicate issues join us on our discord channel</h2>",
